5
00:01:00,458 --> 00:01:02,167
And for a while, it works.

6
00:01:07,333 --> 00:01:08,917
Until it doesn't.

7
00:01:18,042 --> 00:01:21,667
Until you make a choice
that renders everything worthless.

8
00:01:26,083 --> 00:01:27,750
One you can't justify.

9
00:01:31,917 --> 00:01:33,292
Can't forgive.

10
00:01:37,167 --> 00:01:39,792
And it takes everything.

11
00:01:42,250 --> 00:01:43,500
Your family.

12
00:01:46,917 --> 00:01:47,917
Your friends.

13
00:01:54,125 --> 00:01:55,167
Your self.

14
00:02:04,042 --> 00:02:06,458
And then all you're left with is nothing.

15
00:02:09,083 --> 00:02:12,042
Nothing but ghosts.

16
00:02:33,542 --> 00:02:36,667
Pull over! Stop the truck now!

17
00:02:37,167 --> 00:02:39,167
Pull me in!

18
00:02:57,583 --> 00:03:00,833
Stop your vehicle! Stop your vehicle now!

19
00:03:04,583 --> 00:03:06,708
This is fucked. This is so fucked!

20
