Go!

32
00:04:36,708 --> 00:04:38,625
Come on!

33
00:05:43,958 --> 00:05:45,417
Oh fuck.

34
00:06:00,333 --> 00:06:01,333
Oh God!

35
00:06:03,417 --> 00:06:05,250
